                      (    forth6809.asm):03912         
E553 3268             (    forth6809.asm):03913                     LEAS  8,S               ; drop saved input source
E555 3262             (    forth6809.asm):03914                     LEAS  2,S               ; saved U
E557 3506             (    forth6809.asm):03915                     PULS  D
