E57D 3506             (    forth6809.asm):03942                     PULS  D
E57F DD39             (    forth6809.asm):03943                     STD   SRCADDR
E581 3506             (    forth6809.asm):03944                     PULS  D
E583 1F03             (    forth6809.asm):03945                     TFR   D,U
